Article 1 (Enforcement Date)
This Decree shall enter into force on October 12, 2023.

Article 2 (Applicability of Deemed Submission of Performance Reports by Local Government Subsidized Operators)
The amended provisions of Article 9(2) shall apply beginning with cases where a performance report is submitted to the head of the relevant local government through the integrated subsidy management network under Article 26-2(1) of the Subsidy Management Act after this Decree enters into force.

Article 3 (Applicability of Exceptions to Restrictions on Disposal of Important Property)
The amended provisions of Article 13 shall apply beginning with important property acquired after this Decree enters into force by a local government that is a local government subsidized operator.

